{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;cohabitation life simulation&quot; where you live under the same roof as the heroine and interact freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily serves as your maid and spends day and night with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a tavern together, deepen your bond, and enjoy life in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The long war has ended, leaving knights and mercenaries without work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living quietly in the tavern left by your grandfather, you one day take in a lone girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your carefree retirement comes to an end,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a busy life of running the tavern alongside Lily begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Life with Lily</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the tavern or bedroom, you can interact with the heroine through conversation and physical contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose various actions, such as stroking her through touch commands or inviting her to sexual activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Tavern Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ingredients from city shops or the outskirts and cook original dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting up prepared menus and furnishings will affect the tavern's management and the player stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Intimacy Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through interaction commands and touch actions, you can freely engage in sexual activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you act, the more Lily will open up to new experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Lily\u2019s Dress-Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change Lily\u2019s hairstyle and outfit separately between workwear and nightwear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various parts such as bangs, back hair, hair accessories, outfit, and underwear can be collected.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561400?t=1758251264","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561400/6aebfd1fb8f704ab1ef9589cd175feb23c9b9973/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758251264","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561400/a1b377cbc3649518007022c08578fc4cc2cfb3e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758251264","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561400/a1b377cbc3649518007022c08578fc4cc2cfb3e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758251264","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"- A naughty live-in with a maid\r\n- Sexual activity with a close female\r\n- Contains extreme sexual content"},"demos":[{"appid":3767880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;cohabitation life simulation&quot; where you live under the same roof as the heroine and interact freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily serves as your maid and spends day and night with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a tavern together, deepen your bond, and enjoy life in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The long war has ended, leaving knights and mercenaries without work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living quietly in the tavern left by your grandfather, you one day take in a lone girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your carefree retirement comes to an end,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a busy life of running the tavern alongside Lily begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Life with Lily</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the tavern or bedroom, yo